{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le12ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: Adam! How was the interview with the author?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: It was a disaster! It was as disastrous as that time you had me help you with that art assignment.<br><span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: What happened?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I got in my car this morning and realized I was running low on gas! The tank had to be filled up. Anyways, I get to the gas station. I had the attendant pump my gas, paid and was on my way to meet the author.<br><span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: What time was your interview?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: 10 a.m. but ... I didn't get there till 11. The author had me wait for 30 minutes. As I was waiting to be called in, I looked through my bag to make sure I had everything. I realized my notepad was nowhere to be found and I needed it!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le12ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: What did you do?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I had the receptionist lend me a notebook. That was embarrassing!<br><span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: Jeez. What happened after?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I went in, apologized for my tardiness and we started.<br><span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: How was it?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: It was going well until the end. I had finished up the interview. As I was extending my hand out for a handshake, I knocked over a mug and spilt coffee all over the carpet.<br><span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: You didn't?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yep. Mr. Duncan kept insisting it was fine but that carpet definitely needs to be cleaned.", "id": 2, "time": "39000", "image": "engenn10le12ob05re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: Oh Adam.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Then, I got to the office and was about to start writing my bio, only to realize my notes had vanished. I couldn't find them anywhere and the article had to be completed and handed in by tomorrow.<br><span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: So what did you do?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I got Mr. Brody to give me an extra day but he didn't seem pleased, so I started to panic and did something horrible.<br><span class=\"strong\">Hayley</span>: What?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I got Kristi to give me her laptop and when she stepped out ... I copied her notes.", "id": 3, "time": "69400", "image": "engenn10le12ob05re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le12ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le12ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}